WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.769 --> 00:00:04.804
- DAMN, SHE WAS FLY.
- SHE A'IGHT.

00:00:04.904 --> 00:00:06.639
YO, MAN.
CAN I ASK YOU A QUESTION?

00:00:06.739 --> 00:00:08.040
- YEAH. WHAT?

00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:09.876
- WHY EVERYBODY MESSING
WITH THE BATMAN?

00:00:09.976 --> 00:00:11.243
- [clicks tongue] SEE?

00:00:11.344 --> 00:00:14.180
THAT'S EXACTLY
WHAT I'VE BEEN ASKING MYSELF.

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:15.248
- IT DON'T MAKE NO SENSE.

00:00:15.348 --> 00:00:16.382
- WHY WOULD YOU DO IT?

00:00:16.482 --> 00:00:17.851
- WHY WOULD YOU DO THAT?

00:00:17.951 --> 00:00:20.353
WHY WOULD YOU TRY AND MESS
WITH THE BATMAN?

00:00:20.453 --> 00:00:22.354
- IT'S FUTILE.
- IT IS.

00:00:22.454 --> 00:00:23.856
- YO, REMEMBER,
HEATH LEDGER TRIED TO.

00:00:23.956 --> 00:00:25.358
- PSH, I MEAN,
THE BATMAN'S GOT ARMOR.

00:00:25.458 --> 00:00:26.693
AND, YOU KNOW,
SOME MARTIAL ARTS

00:00:26.793 --> 00:00:28.961
AND MOVES--
[indistinct]

00:00:29.061 --> 00:00:30.229
- [imitates sound
of bullets deflecting]

00:00:30.329 --> 00:00:31.363
- IT DON'T WORK.
I GOT ARMOR.

00:00:31.463 --> 00:00:32.899
AND THEN MARTIAL ARTS.
- COME ON.

00:00:32.999 --> 00:00:34.801
- ALL YOU GOT IS A PURPLE SUIT
AND SOME PANCAKE MAKEUP.

00:00:34.901 --> 00:00:35.868
- COME ON, MAN.

00:00:35.968 --> 00:00:37.103
- I MEAN, COME ON, MAN.
BATMAN.

00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:39.805
- WHY WOULD YOU...
both: MESS WITH THE BATMAN?

00:00:39.905 --> 00:00:41.741
- THAT'S WHAT I'M SAYING, MAN.

00:00:41.841 --> 00:00:43.109
OH, REMEMBER
WHEN DANNY DEVITO TRIED IT?

00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:44.711
- PSH.
- START WALKING AROUND.

00:00:44.811 --> 00:00:45.745
- TALKING LIKE...

00:00:45.845 --> 00:00:48.782
[both squawking]

00:00:52.117 --> 00:00:53.819
both: COME ON, MAN.

00:00:53.919 --> 00:00:56.989
- I MEAN, THE BATMAN IS A
MULTI-BILLIONAIRE WITH A GRUDGE.

00:00:57.089 --> 00:00:57.990
YOU'RE JUST
A LITTLE FAT MOTHER[bleep]

00:00:58.090 --> 00:00:59.725
IN A TUXEDO WITH AN UMBRELLA.

00:00:59.825 --> 00:01:01.427
- EXACTLY, MAN.
- COME ON, MAN.

00:01:01.527 --> 00:01:04.063
- IT'S LIKE A PRETEND BIRD
CAN'T MESS WITH THE BATMAN.

00:01:04.163 --> 00:01:06.165
- NO WAY. NO WAY.
OUT OF THE QUESTION, MAN.

00:01:06.265 --> 00:01:07.433
BUT JIM CARREY THOUGH.

00:01:07.533 --> 00:01:09.602
- PSH, JIM CARREY THOUGH.

00:01:09.702 --> 00:01:11.170
- JIM CARREY.
- COME ON.

00:01:11.270 --> 00:01:12.338
"RIDDLE ME THIS.

00:01:12.438 --> 00:01:15.274
RIDDLE ME THAT, MAN."

00:01:15.374 --> 00:01:17.143
HOW IS ACE VENTURA
GONNA MESS WITH THE BATMAN?

00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:18.377
- WELL PLAYED. WELL PLAYED.
- HOW IS ACE VENTURA--

00:01:18.477 --> 00:01:19.545
- WELL PLAYED.

00:01:19.645 --> 00:01:21.748
- "HEY, BATMAN.
I'VE COME TO GET YOU."

00:01:21.848 --> 00:01:22.748
- [imitates whipping sound]

00:01:22.848 --> 00:01:23.950
- AAH!
- NOW SEE.

00:01:24.050 --> 00:01:25.317
HOW ARE YOU SUPPOSED
TO BLOCK A BATARANG

00:01:25.417 --> 00:01:28.321
FROM GOING IN YOUR BUTT WITH
A CAREFULLY CRAFTED QUERY?

00:01:28.421 --> 00:01:30.356
- YOU CANNOT. THAT'S HOW.
- IT'S IMPOSSIBLE.

00:01:30.456 --> 00:01:32.358
- HEY. HEY, PSH.
HEY, PSH. HEY, PSH.

00:01:32.458 --> 00:01:33.927
- MICHELLE PFEIFFER.
- MICHELLE PFEIFFER.

00:01:34.027 --> 00:01:36.896
- - MICHELLE PFEIFFER TRIED
TO MESS WITH THE BATMAN.

00:01:36.996 --> 00:01:39.331
MICHELLE PFEIFFER TRIED TO MESS
WITH THE BATMAN.

00:01:39.431 --> 00:01:40.533
- MICHELLE PFEIFFER.

00:01:40.633 --> 00:01:41.934
- MICHELLE PFEIFFER...
- MICHELLE PFEIFFER.

00:01:42.034 --> 00:01:43.069
- TRIED TO MESS
WITH THE BATMAN.

00:01:43.169 --> 00:01:44.870
- MICHELLE PFEIFFER.
- MICHELLE PFEIFFER.

00:01:44.970 --> 00:01:46.172
- GUESS WHAT,
MICHELLE PFEIFFER?

00:01:46.272 --> 00:01:48.141
YOU AIN'T A REAL CAT!
- COME ON.

00:01:48.241 --> 00:01:49.408
I'LL TELL YOU ONE THING.

00:01:49.509 --> 00:01:51.877
AIN'T NO WAY YOU GONNA MEOW-S
WITH THE BATMAN.

00:01:51.978 --> 00:01:54.080
- BUT WHAT ABOUT
ARNOLD SCHWARZENEGGER THOUGH?

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:55.081
WHAT'S ARNOLD SCHWARZENEGGER
TRYING TO DO?

00:01:55.181 --> 00:01:56.115
- COME ON, MAN.

00:01:56.215 --> 00:01:57.316
- WHAT IS
ARNOLD SCHWARZENEGGER--

00:01:57.417 --> 00:01:59.618
FEEL THE BURN. FEEL THE BURN.
FEEL THE BURN.

00:01:59.718 --> 00:02:01.587
- [grunts]
- IT SHOULD BE IN YOUR TRICEPS.

00:02:01.687 --> 00:02:03.222
- COME ON, MAN.
- ARNOLD SCHWARZENEGGER--

00:02:03.322 --> 00:02:04.457
- YOU CAN'T TURN UP THE AC

00:02:04.557 --> 00:02:06.258
AND THINK THAT'S GONNA MESS
WITH THE BATMAN.

00:02:06.358 --> 00:02:07.360
- WHAT IS IT SUPPOSED TO BE
DOING TO THE BATMAN?

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:09.095
GIVING THE BATMAN A COLD?
- COME ON, MAN.

00:02:09.195 --> 00:02:10.462
- GIVING THE BATMAN
A SNIFFLE?

00:02:10.562 --> 00:02:12.165
- MAN, TALKING
ABOUT BAT LOZENGE.

00:02:12.265 --> 00:02:13.366
- AND YOU WERE DEFEATED.

00:02:13.466 --> 00:02:14.700
- COME ON, MAN.

00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:16.435
YOU KNOW,
THERE IS ONE PERSON THOUGH.

00:02:16.535 --> 00:02:18.071
- OH, NO, NO, NO.
HERE IT COME NOW.

00:02:18.171 --> 00:02:19.071
- THERE IS ONE PERSON
WHO COULD--

00:02:19.171 --> 00:02:20.506
- HERE IT COMES RIGHT NOW.

00:02:20.606 --> 00:02:21.607
- MM-HMM.
- NO, NO, NO, NO, NO, NO.

00:02:21.707 --> 00:02:22.608
- THERE'S ONE PERSON
WHO COULD...

00:02:22.708 --> 00:02:23.910
- HERE IT COMES RIGHT NOW.

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:26.979
- DID, AND SHALL AGAIN
BESTED THE BATMAN.

00:02:27.079 --> 00:02:28.114
- NO, NO, NO.
- WHOO!

00:02:28.214 --> 00:02:30.816
BOY, HERE IT COMES.
- HE TRAINED THE BATMAN.

00:02:30.916 --> 00:02:33.386
HE GAVE THE BATMAN HIS SKILLS.

00:02:33.486 --> 00:02:34.820
HE'S A MIRROR IMAGE
OF THE BATMAN

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:36.889
IN FIGHTING PROWESS.

00:02:36.989 --> 00:02:39.792
I'M TALKING ABOUT...
BOTH: RA'S AL GHUL!

00:02:39.892 --> 00:02:40.927
THAT'S RIGHT, DOG.
RIGHT THERE.

00:02:41.027 --> 00:02:42.761
TALK ABOUT STRAIGHT UP
RA'S AL GHUL.

00:02:42.861 --> 00:02:46.332
PLAYED BY THE INCOMPARABLE...
both: LIAM NEESON.

00:02:46.432 --> 00:02:49.902
- SO EVEN WHEN WE ARE TALKING
ABOUT THE BATMAN...

00:02:50.002 --> 00:02:55.942
both: LIAM NEESON
IS MY [bleep].

